2026-11-04T01:46:01.6302184Z [36;1m# webkit's SYSTEM deps are most of the apt download: gstreamer,[0m
2026-11-04T01:46:01.6303434Z [36;1m# libavcodec/libavfilter, libflite (13.6 MB on its own) — 181 packages[0m
2026-11-04T01:46:01.6304849Z [36;1m# and ~120 MB with webkit against a handful of fonts without it. That[0m
2026-11-04T01:46:01.6306092Z [36;1m# download is what a crawling Azure mirror kills (see the install step),[0m
2026-11-04T01:46:01.6307472Z [36;1m# so the lane that runs five slices a day long pays for the engine it[0m
2026-11-04T01:46:01.6308761Z [36;1m# never starts. Every other app keeps both (jobtracker runs the iOS one).[0m
