2026-11-04T02:35:51.4973739Z `pr-lap.sh` § THE LAP LOCK measures what pushing over a live holder costs, from run #1132: *"the holding run's merge of dev, its ten-minute re-derive, check.sh and smoke were all thrown away."* So I did not push, relap, reset, open a replacement PR, claim T-2388, or fall back to another ticket. PR #1687 stays open, non-draft, `resume`, head unchanged; T-2388 stays `open`/unclaimed.
